   UWorld-embedded manager at world +0x438.
   4. Process this component's latent actions with the world's current delta at +0x940.
   
   Parameters:
     pComponent: actor component instance.
     flDeltaTime: forwarded to ReceiveTick.
     dwTickType: inherited ABI value; this implementation does not read it directly.
     pThisTickFunction: inherited ABI pointer; this implementation does not read it directly.
   
   Returns:
     void.
   
   Rollback relevance:
   The inherited tail of ProcessLuxTraceComponentFixedStepTick is not a no-op. It synchronously
   resolves and dispatches ReceiveTick through ProcessEvent, then may mutate the world/level
   FLatentActionManager and invoke arbitrary latent-action updates and queued UObject callbacks for
   the component. Manual trace resimulation must preserve this exact order, prove the
   process-specific callback/action topology, and suppress the later ordinary outer tick for the
   same logical frame.
   
   Source:
   SoulcaliburVI.exe 0x141D652A0. ReceiveTick dispatch is 0x1421F9CC0; latent-action processing is
   0x141ED7750; the CVar registration at 0x140251D60 names the policy; the fixed-step caller is
   0x1408D8BF0. */

